ve topics and vocabulary related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Asking and Saying Where Things Are"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can ask where something is with the question:  <span class=\"italic\"> Where is ... ?</span> or <span class=\"italic\">\"Is there a ... nearby?\""}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  Where is the pharmacy? "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can say where things are using certain expressions."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  It's over there, down the hall."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Asking\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Saying\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Where is the pharmacy?<br/>Is there a pharmacy in this mall?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Go down here.<br>Go straight. <br/>Turn right at the corner.<br/>Turn left at the next block.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "mall"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a building with many stores"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  I love the new mall!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le07ob11aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you hear when you are in a pharmacy."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "hand"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "part of the body with fingers"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The sleeves are the too long. They cover my hands. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le07ob11aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "reduced"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the price is lower"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: These shoes are reduced from $125 to $50."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le07ob11aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "blister"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "mark on the skin, often caused by wearing new shoes"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have blisters on my foot."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le07ob11aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pharmacy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a store where you can buy health products"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Is there a pharmacy in this mall?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le07ob11aud05"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn2le07ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Find 3 pieces of clothing and 3 accessories."}, {"type": "text", "content": " For each item, write the word, size and price in the chart."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice saying the words in a sentence. "}, {"type": "text", "content": " Talk about the clothing with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you say prices, follow these examples: <ul> <li>$2 - <span class=\"italic\">two dollars</span></li> <li>$2.50 - <span class=\"italic\">two fifty</span> or <span class=\"italic\">two dollars and fifty cents</span></li> <li>$20.99 - <span class=\"italic\">twenty ninety-nine</span> or twenty dollars and ninety-nine cents</li> <li>$209.00 - <span class=\"italic\">two hundred and nine dollars</span> or <span class=\"italic\">two o nine</span></li> <li>$299.00 - <span class=\"italic\">two hundred and ninety-nine dollars</span> or <span class=\"italic\">two ninety-nine</span></li></ul>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Item\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Size\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Price\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Clothing (jacket, pants, shirt)<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Clothing(jacket, pants, shirt)</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp; <br/>&nbsp; <br/>&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Accessory(belt, shoes, boots)</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp; <br/>&nbsp; <br/>&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I identify 6 pieces of clothing or accessories."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I identify the size and price of clothing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I practice saying sizes and prices."}]}], "type": "sena"}